# html2canvas Export

<version>1.0.0</version>

## Context
- Image export logic

## Requirements
- Use `html2canvas(node, { scale: 2, backgroundColor: '#fff' })`
- Restore DOM state after export
- Support multiple export sizes

## Examples
<example>
html2canvas(node, { scale: 2, backgroundColor: '#fff' })
</example>
<example type="invalid">
html2canvas(node)
</example>
